    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Naas is a key retail and commercial centre within the Greater Dublin Area, located approximately 37 km south-west of Dublin City Centre. The subject property is situated on the Dublin Road, approximately200m from Poplar Square in the heart of the Town. The proeprty is also 2 km from Junction 9 of the M7 motorway, providing good connectivity to the wider regional road network and Dublin.\nThe subject property comprises a ground-floor mid-terrace office/retail unit extending to approximately 60.38 sq. m. (650 sq. ft.). The property occupies a high-profile position on the Dublin Road and benefits from a large display window and approximately 7 metres of prominent frontage. Internally, the accommodation comprises a modern reception area, office, kitchenette and toilet facilities, with access to a rear yard."
